<title>RUSSIA: RUSSIA TO AUCTION 13.5 TRLN RBLS OF T-BILLS AUG 20.</title>
<headline>RUSSIA TO AUCTION 13.5 TRLN RBLS OF T-BILLS AUG 20.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Finance Ministry will auction 5.50 trillion roubles ($947.6 million) in an issue of 119-day GKO discount Treasury bills and eight trillion roubles in an issue of 364-day T-bills, both on August 20, the central bank said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Full details of the 119-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>    Series number		    21087</p>
<p>    Issue volume		     5.50 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		    1.00 million rbls</p>
<p>    Issue date			 Aug 20, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor				119 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		    Dec 17, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 364-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>    Series number		    21086</p>
<p>    Issue volume		     8.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		    1.00 million rbls</p>
<p>    Issue date			 Aug 20, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor				364 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		    Aug 19, 1998</p>
<p>On August 20, the Finance Ministry will repay about 9.51 trillion roubles of a maturing issue of 227-day T-bills (series 22065).</p>
<p>--Julie Tolkacheva, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
